modules stress n 128: files in one package
small-fns stress n 1024: small functions
huge-fns stress n 2048: statements in four functions
deep-nesting stress n 16: block and expression nesting depth
wide-enums stress n 64: enum variants and arms per match table
impls-traits stress n 128: types with four trait impls each (traits = n/8)
generics stress n 128: distinct generic instantiations
comptime stress n 128: comptime (prep) items with record types
data-tables stress n 2048: literal table elements
imports stress n 128: files importing five Core modules
call-chains stress n 256: call depth
errors stress n 128: fallible functions with propagation and recovery
diagnostics stress n 128: reported errors
strings stress n 1024: interpolation holes (64 literal bytes each)
fan-in stress n 1024: call sites into shared helpers
web domain lines 125000: web/backend service: models, repositories, routes, templates, queries, roles
game domain lines 125000: game: components and systems, AI state machines, wave tables, inventories, behaviors
cli domain lines 125000: CLI tool: argument parsing, commands, table output, configuration
data domain lines 125000: data analysis: columns, group-by, pipelines, CSV rows
gui domain lines 125000: GUI application: widgets and layout, reducers, styles, events
embedded domain lines 125000: embedded: registers and bit fields, ring buffers, CRC tables, framing state machines
compiler domain lines 125000: compiler/interpreter: lexers, ASTs and evaluators, stack VMs, type tables
scientific domain lines 125000: scientific/numeric: polynomials, quadrature, matrices, ODE steps
generic-lib domain lines 125000: generic-heavy library in one entry file: generic records and functions instantiated per model
generated domain lines 125000: generated code: message structs, registries, lookup tables, accessors
